## 1.1 Platform Analysis

The README states this server is "built to run locally on **macOS**". However, examining the tech stack:
- Python-based (msgraph, azure.identity, FastMCP, uv)
- Uses standard cross-platform packages
- Authentication via Azure DeviceCodeCredential (platform-agnostic)

The macOS requirement appears to be related to Claude Desktop integration rather than the server itself. The core Python application should work on Linux (Ubuntu) since all dependencies are cross-platform. **I will proceed with the deployment on Linux.**

